    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/business-consulting-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Business Consulting Agency theme is a professional and feature-rich solution crafted for consulting firms, business consultants, individual consultants, PR agencies, market research firms, and crisis management specialists looking to enhance their online presence. This theme is tailored for businesses focused on areas such as business consulting, public relations, market research, digital transformation, cloud solutions, and growth strategies, providing an intuitive platform to showcase expertise, case studies, and ROI-driven frameworks. Whether managing a consulting franchise or presenting a consulting agency portfolio, its modern, responsive, and mobile-friendly design guarantees a seamless browsing experience across devices. With customizable layouts, banners, call-to-action sections, portfolio galleries, and blog integration for thought leadership, firms can effectively promote their services and build trust. It is particularly well-suited for industry consulting in education, healthcare, finance, marketing, corporate services, and IT. The theme seamlessly integrates with SEO tools and social media platforms and is fully compatible with Contact Form 7 for client inquiries and lead management. Additionally, it supports popular plugins like WooCommerce for service bookings, Yoast SEO for optimization, Jetpack for analytics, and Mailchimp for email marketing automation. With engaging visual elements and professional layouts, the Business Consulting Agency theme enhances any consulting brand's credibility and drives client engagement, making it perfect for corporate consulting, business planning, strategy planning, coaching, startup advisory, and digital marketing services while establishing a strong online presence. Demo Link - https://pattern.cretathemes.com/business-consulting-agency/"
    },
